#: src/app/handlers/start.py:32 src/app/handlers/start.py:38
msgid "Start text"
msgstr ""
"🔥 Hello! Welcome to @ttnowatermark_bot.\n"
"\n"
"With the bot you can download:\n"
"\n"
"📥 Video download function:\n"
"• <b>Instagram</b> — post and IGTV + music, audio\n"
"• <b>TikTok</b> — video without watermark + music, audio\n"
"• <b>YouTube</b> —  Videos and shorts + music, audio\n"
"\n"
"🎵 Shazam function:\n"
"• Song name or artist name\n"
"• Song lyrics\n"
"• Voice message\n"
"• Video\n"
"• Audio\n"
"• Video message\n"
"\n"
"🎛 Function for adding effects to audio, music and video:\n"
"•🎧 8D format\n"
"•🏟 Concert Hall\n"
"•⚡️ Speed up format\n"
"•🐢 Slow down format\n"
"\n"
"🚀 Send a link to the video you want to download!"

